# car_ride_home.dialogue: Fiona drives Layla's car back to Fiona's apartment after the university.
#
# hooks provided by the car scene (levels/car/car_ride_home.gd):
#   do car_darkness() / do car_reveal(1.5)    black screen / fade the car in
#   do car_bump(1.0)                          a bump; 0.5 small, 1.5 big
#   do car_speed(0.0, 1.5)                    ease to a stop over 1.5 s (a red light); car_speed(1.0) = cruising
#   do car_think_begin() / do car_think_end() Fiona drifts into thought (slow push-in + the dream as a
#                                             faint mental image) / snaps out of it
#   do car_end()                              fade to black at the end of the ride. the real car scene
#                                             returns to the memory box here.
#   do car_fiona("sideways frown")           step 2.299: Fiona's eyes / mouth / pose by option name (a short
#                                             crossfade). eyes: straight sideways squished. mouth: frown smile o
#                                             open_happy open_neutral. pose: base hand_up pointing_up. leave a part
#                                             out to keep it; "default" = straight frown base.
#   do car_closeup()                         step 2.305: a quick fade through black to a close-up of Fiona's
#                                             face, for her inner moments. car_closeup(0.4) = seconds per half.
#   do car_closeup_end()                     fade back to the normal view. car_closeup_end(0.4) = same.
#                                             Fiona's changes asked for during a fade never show mid-cut: going in,
#                                             they happen behind the black; coming out, after the fade back in.
#   do car_layla("glance smile")            step 2.383-2.387: Layla's parts by option name, like car_fiona.
#                                            pose: straight side (side = turned toward Fiona).
#                                            facing forward - eyes: regular closed glance sad. brows: base
#                                            glance_brows sad_brows. mouth: neutral flat smile small_open
#                                            open_happy. blush: no_blush cute_blush. face: no_face
#                                            flustered_face (a whole face; hides the others while it shows).
#                                            turned (only show with "side") - eyes: side_eyes (at Fiona)
#                                            side_away side_closed side_sad. brows: side_brows side_lowered
#                                            side_tilted_1
#                                            side_tilted_2. mouth: side_frown side_smile side_open_happy
#                                            side_o side_sad_mouth. blush: no_side_blush side_blush. lines:
#                                            no_side_lines side_lines. "default" = straight, and every part
#                                            back to its default.
#   do car_layla_closeup()                  step 2.388: a slow push-in on Layla's face (her own close-up),
#                                            no fade; do car_layla_closeup_end() eases back out. seconds
#                                            optional (default: the scene's layla_zoom_seconds)
#   do car_layla_mood("warm", "distant")    step 2.388: car_layla() with the first spec, or the second when
#                                            she's distant (layla_closeness below 0)
#
# mood: Flags.get_game_counter("layla_closeness") -> close >= 3, neutral 0 to under 3, distant < 0.
# chapter memories: the university level copies these level flags into game flags with a "kb_" prefix
# (the car scene has no LevelStateManager, so level flags are always false here):
#   kb_layla_work_comforted, kb_layla_work_reprimanded   (Layla hub, "Ask her about work")
#   kb_julian_refused_help, kb_julian_nearly_told_truth  (julian_talk, one of the two is always set)
#   kb_layla_gift_given, kb_layla_gift_loved             (layla_gifts; given = any snack, loved = protein bar)
#   kb_layla_said_fee                                    (layla_gifts ~ loved, close branch)
#   kb_jayce_flashed, kb_jayce_camera_seen               (janitor route, not built yet: Fiona flashed him /
#                                                         saw what's on his camera. either or both)
# set here, for the next chapter (game flags, all reset to false at the start of every ride):
#   kb_coffee_offered, kb_layla_came_up   (the coffee choice; a distant Layla can decline)
#   kb_car_broke_silence                  (distant: Fiona spoke up instead of leaving her be)
#   kb_car_apologized, kb_car_stood_by    (distant: the repair choice; apologizing also adds +1 closeness)

~ start
do car_darkness()
do car_layla_mood("straight regular base smile no_blush no_face", "straight sad sad_brows flat no_blush no_face", 0.0)
do Flags.set_game_flag("kb_coffee_offered", false)
do Flags.set_game_flag("kb_layla_came_up", false)
do Flags.set_game_flag("kb_car_broke_silence", false)
do Flags.set_game_flag("kb_car_apologized", false)
do Flags.set_game_flag("kb_car_stood_by", false)
Without much ado, you and Layla go to the parking lot and get in her car.
Before long, you're out of the parking lot and onto the freeway.
On your way. Back to your place.
# step 2.405: the ride's music comes up with the car (car_end() fades it with the picture)
do SoundManager.play_music_track("car_ride_back", 4.0)
do car_reveal(1.5)
Layla's car smells exactly how you expected it to.
Like flowers.
Even the teddy bear on the dashboard is so Layla.
Player: (Heh. Guess this really is her car.)
do car_think_begin()
Not long after, your mind begins to wander.
Didn't you... see something?
Right before Layla came to wake you up.
You did. You did indeed.
It was a dream.
A dream with HIM in it.
The person you dread the most.
Who treated you and her so wrong.
Especially her.
Speaking of her... you wonder what she must be doing right now.
It's been a week sin-
if Flags.get_game_counter("layla_closeness") >= 3:
	do car_think_end(0.8)
	do car_fiona("sideways frown")
	do car_layla("side side_eyes side_tilted_1 side_sad_mouth no_side_blush no_side_lines")
	Layla: Ummm... Fiona?
	Layla interrupts your thoughts. Her voice is soft and careful. Her brows are angled in concern.
	Layla: Are you... okay?
	Layla: I don't know. I just felt like I should ask you that.
elif Flags.get_game_counter("layla_closeness") >= 0:
	do car_think_end(0.8)
	do car_fiona("sideways frown")
	do car_layla("side side_eyes side_tilted_1 side_sad_mouth no_side_blush no_side_lines")
	Layla: ...Fiona?
	Layla's gentle voice halts your racing thoughts. She sounds unsure whether she should have spoken at all.
	Layla: Sorry. You just looked... so far away.
	Layla: Are you okay?
else
	do car_layla("straight sad sad_brows flat no_blush no_face")
	Layla doesn't seem to have noticed your lil mid-drive daydream.
	Instead, she seems to be looking out the window, lost in a daydream of her own.
	do car_bump(1.0)
	do car_think_end(0.4)
	The car jolts over a bump, bringing you back to reality.
	=> distant_ride
do car_fiona("straight open_neutral hand_up")
do car_layla("side side_eyes side_tilted_1 side_frown no_side_blush no_side_lines")
Player: Oh, yeah, of course.
Player: Sorry, I guess I zoned out for a second there.
do car_fiona("sideways frown base")
do car_layla("side side_eyes side_brows side_smile no_side_blush no_side_lines")
Layla: That's alright.
=> long_day

~ long_day
do car_fiona("squished open_neutral hand_up")
Player: So, it's barely afternoon...
Player: But it already feels like the end of a long-ass day, doesn't it?
do car_fiona("straight frown base")
if Flags.get_game_counter("layla_closeness") >= 3:
	do car_layla("straight closed base open_happy no_blush no_face")
	Layla: Oh Em Gee! Yes! I am SO tired.
	do car_layla("straight regular base small_open no_blush no_face")
	Layla: But that could be a side effect of worrying too much about the work.
else
	do car_layla("straight regular sad_brows small_open no_blush no_face")
	Layla: Honestly? Yes. I'm exhausted.
	Layla: I think worrying about the work got me more worn out than the work itself.
do car_layla("straight glance base open_happy no_blush no_face")
Layla: All of that only for the professor to call and tell us he's taking a day off!
do car_fiona("sideways open_neutral")
do car_layla("straight regular base smile no_blush no_face")
Player: Yeah. Bet that was a relief for you, wasn't it?
do car_fiona("frown")
if Flags.get_game_counter("layla_closeness") >= 3:
	do car_layla("side side_closed side_brows side_open_happy no_side_blush no_side_lines")
	Layla: You bet, Fee!
	if Flags.get_game_flag("kb_layla_said_fee") == true:
		do car_fiona("squished frown")
		do car_layla("side side_eyes side_brows side_smile no_side_blush no_side_lines")
		Player: (Fee again...)
	else
		do car_fiona("squished frown")
		do car_layla("side side_eyes side_brows side_smile no_side_blush no_side_lines")
		Player: (Fee...)
else
	do car_fiona("frown")
	do car_layla("straight regular base small_open no_blush no_face")
	Layla: It really was.
=> thanks

~ thanks
# each line is gated on what actually happened; the mood only sets the tone.
do car_fiona("straight frown")
if Flags.get_game_counter("layla_closeness") >= 3:
	do car_layla("side side_eyes side_tilted_2 side_sad_mouth no_side_blush no_side_lines")
	do car_layla_closeup()
	Layla: You were too kind to me today. Honestly.
	if Flags.get_game_flag("kb_layla_work_comforted") == true:
		Layla: You made me feel confident in my abilities.
	elif Flags.get_game_flag("kb_layla_work_reprimanded") == true:
		do car_layla("straight sad sad_brows small_open no_blush no_face")
		Layla: I know you were kind of harsh with me earlier.
		Layla: But I think I probably needed to hear it.
		do car_layla("straight regular base small_open no_blush no_face")
		Layla: Yeah, it was a much-needed reality check. Thanks for that.
	if Flags.get_game_flag("kb_julian_refused_help") == true:
		do car_layla("side side_eyes side_tilted_2 side_open_happy no_side_blush no_side_lines")
		Layla: You didn't tell Julian about my role and my unfinished work...
		do car_layla("side side_eyes side_tilted_2 side_sad_mouth no_side_blush no_side_lines")
		Layla: I really didn't want that to happen...
	elif Flags.get_game_flag("kb_julian_nearly_told_truth") == true:
		do car_layla("straight sad sad_brows small_open no_blush no_face")
		Layla: You almost told Julian about my role and my unfinished work, though...
		do car_layla("side side_eyes side_tilted_1 side_open_happy no_side_blush no_side_lines")
		Layla: But you stopped. That counts, right?
	do car_layla("side side_eyes side_brows side_open_happy no_side_blush no_side_lines")
	Layla: You actually helped me get my work done quickly.
	Layla: Which, by the way, you are SO good at?
	if Flags.get_game_flag("kb_layla_gift_loved") == true:
		do car_layla("straight closed base open_happy no_blush no_face")
		Layla: And you even got me my favorite snack from the vending machine!
	elif Flags.get_game_flag("kb_layla_gift_given") == true:
		do car_layla("straight closed base open_happy no_blush no_face")
		Layla: And you even got me a snack from the vending machine!
	do car_fiona("sideways frown")
	do car_layla("side side_eyes side_brows side_open_happy side_blush side_lines")
	Layla: You're the best!! Thank you, Fee.
	do car_closeup()
	do car_fiona("squished frown")
	Player: (Ehhh...)
	Player: (I'm flattered, but I can't let this go to my head.)
	do car_closeup_end()
	do car_fiona("sideways open_neutral")
	do car_layla("straight glance base smile cute_blush no_face")
	Player: Don't... mention it.
	do car_fiona("open_neutral")
	Player: I'm just happy I was able to help.
else
	do car_layla("straight regular base small_open no_blush no_face")
	do car_layla_closeup()
	Layla: By the way, thanks a lot for today.
	if Flags.get_game_flag("kb_layla_work_comforted") == true:
		Layla: What you said earlier, about my work... It really helped.
	elif Flags.get_game_flag("kb_layla_work_reprimanded") == true:
		do car_layla("straight glance sad_brows small_open no_blush no_face")
		Layla: Even if you were a bit harsh with me earlier.
	if Flags.get_game_flag("kb_julian_refused_help") == true:
		do car_layla("side side_eyes side_brows side_open_happy no_side_blush no_side_lines")
		Layla: And thanks for not telling Julian about my role and unfinished work.
	elif Flags.get_game_flag("kb_julian_nearly_told_truth") == true:
		if Flags.get_game_flag("kb_layla_work_reprimanded") == true:
			do car_layla("straight sad sad_brows small_open no_blush no_face")
			Layla: And you almost told Julian about my role and unfinished work...
		else
			do car_layla("straight sad sad_brows small_open no_blush no_face")
			Layla: Even though you almost told Julian about my role and unfinished work...
		Layla: I'm trying not to think about that.
		do car_fiona("squished frown")
		do car_layla("straight sad sad_brows flat no_blush no_face")
		Player: (Ouch.)
		do car_fiona("sideways frown")
	do car_layla("straight regular base small_open no_blush no_face")
	Layla: You really helped me get my work done. Quick, too.
	if Flags.get_game_flag("kb_layla_gift_loved") == true:
		do car_layla("straight glance base small_open no_blush no_face")
		Layla: And hey, the protein bar. That was sweet of you.
	elif Flags.get_game_flag("kb_layla_gift_given") == true:
		do car_layla("straight glance base small_open no_blush no_face")
		Layla: And the snack, too.
	do car_layla("side side_eyes side_tilted_2 side_sad_mouth no_side_blush no_side_lines")
	Layla: So... thank you. Really.
	do car_fiona("sideways open_neutral")
	do car_layla_closeup_end()
	do car_layla("side side_eyes side_tilted_2 side_smile no_side_blush no_side_lines")
	Player: Don't mention it.
	do car_fiona("open_neutral")
	Player: I'm just happy I was able to help.
=> getting_to_know

~ getting_to_know
# step 2.295: close and neutral share this section; the flirty beats are close only. distant layla never reaches it.
do car_fiona("straight frown")
do car_layla("side side_eyes side_brows side_open_happy no_side_blush no_side_lines")
Layla: You know, I'd love to know more about you, Fiona.
Layla: I mean, I know we've known each other since we were kids...
Layla: But before this semester, I hadn't seen you in like... 14 years!
do car_layla("side side_eyes side_brows side_smile no_side_blush no_side_lines")
do car_closeup()
do car_fiona("straight frown")
Player: (That's right.)
Player: (We grew up together in the same town, until I was six.)
do car_fiona("squished")
Player: (But everything changed when my family had to move away.)
do car_closeup_end()
do car_fiona("sideways open_neutral hand_up")
do car_layla("straight regular base smile no_blush no_face")
Player: I really don't know what to tell you, Layla.
do car_fiona("straight")
Player: I mean, I'm practically working all the time. Even when I'm not at the lab.
Player: Apart from that, I do like to hit the gym when I can.
do car_fiona("open_happy pointing_up")
Player: Oh, and reading. Reading's neat.
do car_fiona("sideways base frown")
do car_layla("straight glance glance_brows small_open no_blush no_face")
Layla: Really? Is that all you do?
do car_layla("side side_eyes side_brows side_open_happy no_side_blush no_side_lines")
Layla: There's gotta be more! Tell me about your friends! Do you go out with them?
do car_layla("straight glance glance_brows open_happy no_blush no_face")
Layla: What about your BOYFRIEND? Do you have one?
if Flags.get_game_counter("layla_closeness") >= 3:
	do car_layla("straight glance base small_open cute_blush no_face")
	Layla: Is he prettier than me?
do car_fiona("open_neutral")
do car_layla("straight regular base smile no_blush no_face")
Player: What? No. I don't have a boyfriend.
do car_fiona("straight open_neutral")
Player: Not too many friends either.
do car_fiona("squished hand_up")
Player: Jeez, honestly, I can't recall the last time I hung out with anyone except my mom.
do car_fiona("straight frown base")
do car_layla("side side_eyes side_tilted_1 side_o no_side_blush no_side_lines")
Layla: Really? I never would've guessed that!
do car_layla("straight regular base small_open no_blush no_face")
Layla: I actually saw you with a guy in the cafeteria a couple of weeks ago.
Layla: And then, a few days later - a girl!
do car_layla("straight sad base small_open cute_blush no_face")
Layla: She was so good-looking, too!
do car_layla("straight glance base small_open cute_blush no_face")
Layla: I thought... you were dating them for sure.
do car_fiona("straight o")
do car_layla("straight glance base flat no_blush no_face")
Player: Oh.
do car_fiona("open_neutral")
Player: Yeah, no. We just hooked up.
Player: They weren't my friends in any sense of the word.
do car_fiona("frown")
# EXPRESSION HOOK (later, needs car art layers): Layla doesn't know how to respond.
do car_layla("straight sad sad_brows flat cute_blush no_face")
Layla doesn't seem to know how to respond. She fidgets with her hands.
if Flags.get_game_counter("layla_closeness") >= 3:
	do car_fiona("frown")
	Layla: Oh...
	do car_layla("straight glance sad_brows small_open cute_blush no_face")
	Layla: So would you... not hook up with... someone you're friends with?
	do car_fiona("sideways open_neutral hand_up")
	do car_layla("straight glance sad_brows flat cute_blush no_face")
	Player: Well, it's not like a policy or anything.
	do car_fiona("open_neutral")
	Player: I suppose I could. Depends on the moment.
	do car_fiona("frown base")
	do car_layla("straight glance base smile cute_blush no_face")
	A smile seems to have returned to her face.
	do car_layla("straight closed base open_happy cute_blush no_face")
	Layla: Oh, I see!
	do car_layla("straight glance base small_open cute_blush no_face")
	Layla: Good! I think you should be friends with anyone you're into.
	Layla: At least to some extent.
	do car_fiona("squished open_neutral")
	do car_layla("straight glance base smile cute_blush no_face")
	Player: Uh huh.
else
	do car_fiona("frown")
	do car_layla("straight regular sad_brows small_open no_blush no_face")
	Layla: Oh... okay! Fair enough.
	do car_layla("straight glance sad_brows flat no_blush no_face")
	She looks like she wants to say more, but won't allow herself to.
if Flags.get_game_flag("kb_jayce_flashed") == true or Flags.get_game_flag("kb_jayce_camera_seen") == true:
	=> janitor_talk
=> arrival

~ janitor_talk
# Fiona got past the janitor (Jayce) by flashing him, or by blackmailing him with what's on his camera
# (only if she picked the camera up). either or both can have happened; every combination reads naturally.
do car_fiona("straight frown base")
do car_layla("straight regular base smile no_blush no_face")
For a minute, there is silence in the car.
Until...
do car_fiona("frown")
do car_layla("straight glance glance_brows small_open no_blush no_face")
Layla: So... that incident with the janitor.
do car_fiona("sideways open_neutral")
do car_layla("straight glance glance_brows flat no_blush no_face")
Player: Yeah. That was... something.
if Flags.get_game_flag("kb_jayce_flashed") == true:
	do car_fiona("hand_up")
	Player: Sorry if the flashing traumatized you.
	do car_fiona("squished")
	Player: It's just... it's the only way you can get sleazebags like him to do anything, you know?
	do car_fiona("sideways frown base")
	# Layla is very much into Fiona and very flustered about it. EXPRESSION / CLOSE-UP HOOKS: to discuss.
	do car_layla("straight flustered_face")
	Layla: [speed=1.8]Oh no! I wasn't traumatized by it in the slightest![/speed]
	Layla: [speed=0.6]I was just...[/speed]
	Layla: Well, let's just say it was a surprise to see your[wait=0.3] [small=0.85]boobies[/small] this fine morning, [speed=1.6]is all.[/speed]
	Layla: But no, "traumatized" is the last word [small=0.9]I'd use...[/small]
	Layla: I mean, it's just boobs, right? [wave amp=12 freq=6]Hehe.[/wave][wait=0.2] [speed=2.4][mutter][small=0.9]Not like I'm into them or anything.[/small][/mutter][/speed] [wave amp=16 freq=8][small=0.85]Hehehehehehehe.[/small][/wave]
	do car_fiona("squished open_neutral")
	Player: Yes. Sure.
if Flags.get_game_flag("kb_jayce_camera_seen") == true:
	if Flags.get_game_flag("kb_jayce_flashed") == true:
		do car_fiona("frown")
		do car_layla("straight regular sad_brows small_open no_blush no_face")
		Layla: But... that camera, though...
	else
		do car_fiona("frown")
		do car_layla("straight glance sad_brows small_open no_blush no_face")
		Layla: About the janitor...
		do car_layla("straight regular sad_brows small_open no_blush no_face")
		Layla: That camera...
	do car_fiona("straight open_neutral")
	do car_layla("straight regular sad_brows flat no_blush no_face")
	Player: Oh, yeah. That was horrendous.
	do car_fiona("sideways pointing_up")
	Player: Let's report him to the administration first thing tomorrow.
	do car_fiona("base frown")
	do car_layla("side side_eyes side_brows side_open_happy no_side_blush no_side_lines")
	Layla: Yes! I'm so glad to hear you say that!
	do car_fiona("open_neutral")
	do car_layla("side side_eyes side_brows side_smile no_side_blush no_side_lines")
	Player: Of course. It's the only thing to do.
=> arrival

~ arrival
do car_fiona("straight frown base")
do car_speed(0.0, 2.5)
do car_layla("straight regular base neutral no_blush no_face")
The car slows to a stop in front of your building.
do car_fiona("sideways open_neutral")
Player: Well, this is it. I'm here.
do car_fiona("frown")
do car_layla("side side_eyes side_brows side_open_happy no_side_blush no_side_lines")
Layla: Great! I'll take the wheel.
Layla: Goodbye, Fiona! Take care!
do car_layla("side side_away side_tilted_2 side_sad_mouth side_blush side_lines")
Layla: And... thanks again!
do car_layla("side side_away side_tilted_2 side_smile side_blush no_side_lines")
do car_layla_closeup()
You take a closer look at Layla's face.
Is there anything you would like to say to her?
- Invite her up for coffee. [matters]
	do Flags.set_game_flag("kb_coffee_offered", true)
	do Flags.set_game_flag("kb_layla_came_up", true)
	do car_fiona("sideways open_neutral")
	do car_layla_closeup_end()
	Player: Umm... would you wanna come up for some coffee before you go?
	do car_layla("side side_eyes side_tilted_1 side_open_happy side_blush side_lines")
	Layla: Umm... yeah, sure. I suppose I could. I do have an hour to spare.
	do car_fiona("open_neutral")
	do car_layla("side side_eyes side_tilted_1 side_smile side_blush no_side_lines")
	Player: Great. Let's park here and go up, then.
	do car_fiona("straight frown")
	The two of you head upstairs together.
- Say goodbye. [matters]
	do Flags.set_game_flag("kb_coffee_offered", false)
	do Flags.set_game_flag("kb_layla_came_up", false)
	do car_fiona("open_neutral hand_up")
	do car_layla_closeup_end()
	Player: No worries, Layla. See you soon.
	do car_fiona("straight frown base")
	You get out of the car and take your leave.
